# Other Applications of Neural Networks to Quantum Mechanical Problems

**Authors:** Lionel Raff, Ranga Komanduri, Martin Hagan, Satish Bukkapatnam

## Abstract
<p>The usual method for solving the vibrational Schrödinger equation to obtain molecular vibrational spectra and the associated wave functions generally involves the expansion of the vibrational wave function, ψk(y), in terms of a linear combination of a set of basis functions.
</p>

